`,e.jsxs(a.p,{children:["This is an operational model, not an X-ray of any provider's private infrastructure; the exact stages differ by provider, and some boxes describe observable API behavior while others describe conceptual inference work. The conclusion hiding in it is still useful: ",e.jsx(a.strong,{children:"LLM APIs are distributed systems wrapped around neural-network inference."}),' The systems around the transformer are often where production symptoms emerge, so a "model problem" deserves a systems investigation before it gets a model diagnosis.']}),`
